"><p begin="2:19.070" end="2:23.154" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.070" end="2:19.687">Ah-</span><span begin="2:19.687" end="2:23.154">ah</span></p><p begin="2:23.457" end="2:27.444" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.457" end="2:24.068">Ah-</span><span begin="2:24.068" end="2:27.444">ah</span></p><p begin="2:27.834" end="2:30.004" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.834" end="2:28.364">你</span><span begin="2:28.364" end="2:28.873">的</span><span begin="2:28.873" end="2:29.128">出</span><span begin="2:29.128" end="2:30.004">现</span></p><p begin="2:30.265" end="2:32.002" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.265" end="2:30.575">你</span><span begin="2:30.575" end="2:31.106">的</span><span begin="2:31.106" end="2:31.423">告</span><span begin="2:31.423" end="2:32.002">别</span></p><p begin="2:32.223" end="2:35.423" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.223" end="2:32.826">都在</span><span begin="2:32.826" end="2:33.033">一</span><span begin="2:33.033" end="2:33.475">瞬</span><span begin="2:33.475" end="2:35.423">间</span></p></div><div begin="2:37.628" end="3:10.275" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:37.628" end="2:41.721" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.628" end="2:41.279">如果问你到底现在的你快不快</span><span begin="2:41.279" end="2:41.721">乐</span></p><p begin="2:42.023" end="2:46.036" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.023" end="2:45.603">人来人往 是谁陪你看着花开花</span><span begin="2:45.603" end="2:46.036">折</span></p><p begin="2:46.415" end="2:52.389" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.415" end="2:47.486">如果那是</span><span begin="2:47.486" end="2:48.234">我</span> <span begin="2:48.596" end="2:50.286">如果你也曾想</span><span begin="2:50.286" end="2:52.389">过</span></p><p begin="2:52.772" end="2:54.810" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.772" end="2:54.035">Whoa,</span> <span begin="2:54.035" end="2:54.810">hoh</span></p><p begin="2:55.181" end="2:59.138" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.181" end="2:58.335">只是世界不能在乎我们快不</span><span begin="2:58.335" end="2:58.732">快</span><span begin="2:58.732" end="2:59.138">乐</span></p><p begin="2:59.397" end="3:03.442" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.397" end="3:02.682">秋去秋来 我们能说什么舍不</span><span begin="3:02.682" end="3:03.442">舍得</span></p><p begin="3:03.779" end="3:10.275" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.779" end="3:05.000">轻轻触碰</span><span begin="3:05.000" end="3:05.736">过</span> <span begin="3:06.052" end="3:07.721">至少不完全错</span><span begin="3:07.721" end="3:10.275">过</span></p></div><div begin="3:11.492" end="3:27.517" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:11.492" end="3:15.497" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.492" end="3:12.115">Ah-</span><span begin="3:12.115" end="3:15.497">ah</span></p><p begin="3:15.808" end="3:19.693" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.808" end="3:16.462">Ah-</span><span begin="3:16.462" end="3:19.693">ah</span></p><p begin="3:20.080" end="3:22.377" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.080" end="3:20.628">谁</span><span begin="3:20.628" end="3:21.298">在</span><span begin="3:21.298" end="3:21.658">怀</span><span begin="3:21.658" end="3:22.377">念</span></p><p begin="3:22.557" end="3:24.298" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.557" end="3:22.974">谁</span><span begin="3:22.974" end="3:23.501">人</span><span begin="3:23.501" end="3:23.809">无</span><span begin="3:23.809" end="3:24.298">眠</span></p><p begin="3:24.468" end="3:27.517" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.468" end="3:25.094">谁已</span><span begin="3:25.094" end="3:25.874">说再</span><span begin="3:25.874" end="3:27.517">见</span></p></div><div begin="3:28.921" end="3:45.082" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:28.921" end="3:32.972" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.921" end="3:29.573">Ah-</span><span begin="3:29.573" end="3:32.972">ah</span></p><p begin="3:33.311" end="3:37.23